# Ojer Taq, Deepest Foundation, a 6/6 with vigilance: "If one or more creature tokens would be created under your control, three times that many of those tokens are
# created instead." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 (Black Lotus and three Moxen). Bot2's Assembly Specialist, cast on turn 2, makes its one Borg token: tokens under an
# opponent's control are not tripled. On turn 3 Bot1's Assembly Specialist makes three Borg tokens, not one and not six; its Thraben Inspector's Clue, a token that is
# not a creature, is made once. Bot1 then attacks with Ojer Taq and, with vigilance (CR 702.20b), it stays untapped.

